GrindCompanio — Licensing Overview
==================================

This monorepo contains multiple components under different licenses.
When distributing or publishing parts of this repository, apply the
license that covers the respective directory.

1) grind-companion/ (Companion mobile app)
   Copyright (c) 2026 freeFuncti0n
   Licensed under the MIT License — see grind-companion/LICENSE

2) smart-grind-by-weight/ (ESP32 firmware, hardware docs, 3D files)
   Derived from smart-grind-by-weight by jaapp and contributors.
   Software: GNU General Public License v3.0 or later — see smart-grind-by-weight/LICENSE
   Hardware designs (STL, mechanical files): CERN-OHL-S v2 — see smart-grind-by-weight/LICENSE

3) Third-party components
   See NOTICE for bundled libraries and their licenses.

This overview file does not replace the full license texts in the paths above.
